### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@csrfToken = reemplaza-por-el-token-csrf

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/

### Página principal
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Sistema con solución única
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/solve/
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: csrftoken={{csrfToken}}

{
  "size": 2,
  "matrix": [
    ["2", "1", "5"],
    ["1", "-1", "1"]
  ]
}

### Sistema con infinitas soluciones
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/solve/
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: csrftoken={{csrfToken}}

{
  "size": 2,
  "matrix": [
    ["1", "1", "2"],
    ["2", "2", "4"]
  ]
}

### Sistema sin solución
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/solve/
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: csrftoken={{csrfToken}}

{
  "size": 2,
  "matrix": [
    ["1", "1", "1"],
    ["2", "2", "3"]
  ]
}

### Intercambio de filas
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/solve/
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: csrftoken={{csrfToken}}

{
  "size": 3,
  "matrix": [
    ["0", "1", "0", "2"],
    ["1", "0", "0", "1"],
    ["0", "0", "1", "3"]
  ]
}
